    <!-- why we are section start -->
    <section class="ca-about-3 travlink-about-values pt-100 pb-70" aria-labelledby="travlink-why-we-are-title">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="travlink-why-we-are">
                <div class="travlink-why-we-are__intro wow tpFadeInUp" data-wow-duration="1.2s" data-wow-delay=".1s">
                    <span class="travlink-why-we-are__eyebrow travlink-about-heading__eyebrow">Why We Are</span>
                    <h2 class="travlink-about-section-title" id="travlink-why-we-are-title">Built to Make International <em>Travel, Trade &amp; Shipping Simpler</em></h2>
                    <div class="travlink-why-we-are__copy">
                        <p>We built Travlink Global because we kept watching the same story repeat—someone pays for a visa, a shipment, or a trip, and then spends weeks chasing updates that never come, over-explaining themselves to agents who go quiet right after the invoice is paid.</p>
                        <p>We didn't think that was good enough, so we decided to do something about it.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="travlink-why-we-are__practice">
                    <h3 class="wow tpFadeInUp" data-wow-duration="1.1s" data-wow-delay=".16s">What That Looks Like in Practice</h3>
                    <ul class="travlink-why-we-are__list">
                        <li class="wow tpFadeInUp" data-wow-duration="1s" data-wow-delay=".2s">
                            <span class="travlink-why-we-are__check" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></span>
                            <p><strong>One point of contact, start to finish</strong>—no passing you between departments.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="wow tpFadeInUp" data-wow-duration="1s" data-wow-delay=".26s">
                            <span class="travlink-why-we-are__check" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></span>
                            <p><strong>Real answers, not automated replies.</strong></p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="wow tpFadeInUp" data-wow-duration="1s" data-wow-delay=".32s">
                            <span class="travlink-why-we-are__check" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></span>
                            <p><strong>Visas, sourcing, and shipping</strong>—handled under one roof.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="wow tpFadeInUp" data-wow-duration="1s" data-wow-delay=".38s">
                            <span class="travlink-why-we-are__check" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></span>
                            <p><strong>Clear timelines and pricing</strong> before you commit to anything.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="wow tpFadeInUp" data-wow-duration="1s" data-wow-delay=".44s">
                            <span class="travlink-why-we-are__check" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></span>
                            <p><strong>We stay involved until it's actually finished</strong>—not just booked, not just paid for.</p>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
