                    <span class="travlink-why-feature__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 13v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2"/><path d="M4 13H2v5h4v-5H4ZM20 13h2v5h-4v-5h2ZM18 18c0 2-2 3-5 3"/></svg></span>
